     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>This has led me in the past decade into a new realm of my destiny. I wrote my first book in January 2025, <em>My Letter to You</em>, based on the Seven Letters to the Churches. This has been after over 45 years of teaching the Word of God. Then, I finished my second book in September 2026, <em>Why the Rapture Tarries</em>. I sense there is more to come, and so I will continue this journey with the Lord to do what He tells me to do.</p>",
