    {
     "id": "860a3d5",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>For more than 45 years, I have had the privilege of teaching the Word of God. For more than 15 years, I have also had the privilege of discipling men coming from prison and drug rehabilitation.</p><p>Those years have taught me something important: people don't simply need more information about God. They need to discover what it means to follow Jesus Christ, grow in spiritual maturity, and live out the purposes of God.</p><p><strong>That conviction is at the heart of my writing and ministry.</strong></p>",
