    {
     "id": "bc9f188",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>This has deeply affected the direction of my life. I have no other goal in life than to see the fruit of believers coming into the fullness of Christ through discipleship. As Paul wrote in Colossians 1:25-29, it bears witness in my soul.</p>",
      "align": "center",
      "text_color": "#D9DCE3",
      "typography_typography": "custom",
      "typography_font_family": "Lato",
      "typography_font_size": {
