    {
     "id": "d2b81b4",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>“Of this Ekklesia, I have been made a disciple maker, according to the stewardship from God bestowed on me, for your benefit, so that I might fully carry out the teaching of God's Word, that is, the mystery that has been hidden in past ages and generations, but has now been manifest in the saints. To whom God willed to make known the riches of the glory of this mystery, which is Christ in you, the hope of Glory! We proclaim Christ!</p><p>Admonishing every man, teaching every man in wisdom, so that we present every man fully grown in Christ. For this purpose, I labor, striving according to His power that works mightily in me.”</p>",
      "align": "center",
      "text_color": "#FFFFFF",
